<title>UK: LME zinc steady in thin PM trade, copper off highs.</title>
<headline>LME zinc steady in thin PM trade, copper off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Hovers just below highs in thin, wary trade. COPPER - Firmer, but off highs. Cash/threes backwardation</p>
<p>narrower at $43/$48.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Strong, but seeing resistance at $1,650.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Rangebound. TIN - Quiet, little changed.</p>
<p>LEAD - Barely weaker under $650.</p>
</text>
